Fuzz driver for the <span id="S2.F2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">crxDecodePlane</span> function (<a href="#S2.F1" title="In 2.1. Function-Level Fuzzing and Fuzz Drivers ‣ 2. Background and Related Work ‣ FalseCrashReducer: Mitigating False Positive Crashes in OSS-Fuzz-Gen Using Agentic AI" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>).
The fuzz driver violates the preconditions of the target function, leading to false positive crashes.
</figcaption>
